WEBVTT

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.700
Welcome back.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.280
We're back!

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:53.460
<b>Menu 2<b> A Moody Cat's Hesitation
 ~Antipasto in the Moonlight~</b></b>

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.580
Splish, splish.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.850
Splish, splish, splish.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:55.420
Splish, splish, splish, splish, splish...

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.470
It's such a nice day!

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:59.930
The perfect weather for 
doing laundry! Right?

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:00.770
Right.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.420
I thought we were done for back there.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.530
Miracle.

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.890
By the way, where's Yuuki?

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.520
He went ahead to meet the client first.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.520
I hope he'll like it!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.890
Miss Karyl said she'll join us later, too.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:21.920
This concludes my report.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:26.030
I will continue to observe 
Yuuki and Pecorine.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.060
Karyl.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.290
Yes?

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:35.650
Are you sure there isn't something 
else you've forgotten to report?

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.800
<i>How...</i>

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.110
<i>That's...</i>

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:55.610
You do recognize this persona, do you not?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.000
<i>She was watching?</i>

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:02.350
<i>She watched our fight through that mask?</i>

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.890
<i>If she did, then she also knows 
I interfered with her plans...</i>

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.040
Still...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.480
Still not enough.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.270
My famished soul is just not enough.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.070
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.640
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.760
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.270
<i>Your Majesty, I'm sorry!</i>

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.940
But I forgive you.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:50.870
You and I are the only blood relationship that 
exists in this world held together with lies...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.480
My sweet Karyl.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.490
Hello!

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.390
Peco lady!

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:25.820
Heya!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.740
It's Ikacchi and Charlie!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.570
Heya!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.770
His hair...

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.660
Whaddya think? Pretty awesome, right?

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.590
That's my bro!

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.930
How crazy!

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.920
I hadn't seen you two around recently.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.730
We were working outta town.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.180
Built up a bit of a tab at Master's, y'know.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.550
And...

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.800
We wanted to let Mama eat 
some really tasty food.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.170
Yasuko!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:54.240
My fool son came back 
after being away so long

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.340
and immediately dragged me out here.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.510
Is it going to rain or something?

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.760
I'm gonna make things even easier for ya!

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.780
You can count on it, Mama!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.450
Don't get ahead of yourself, you nincompoop!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.970
And call me "Mom"!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.800
O-Okay, okay!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.720
That said...

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:18.170
I can only go out for drinks with my son 
like this because you all protected our town.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.760
Thank you.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:25.410
Landosol always needs to be 
filled with everyone's smiles.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.660
That's why!

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:40.950
Miss Pecorine...

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:48.830
You, um... still haven't told my 
lord or Miss Karyl that you are

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.930
Princess Eustiana of Landosol, have you?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:04.960
Thank you for not telling the 
two of them my secret, Kokkoro.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.840
They're very precious to me,

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:11.300
so when the time comes that 
I can tell them the truth,

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.970
I want to tell them myself.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.600
Until that time comes...

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:25.340
Would you... be willing to wait?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.120
Of course.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:36.360
I love you, Kokkoro!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.410
Wrmph...

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.870
<b>PriConne</b>

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.630
Is this it?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.630
Hello...

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.620
Meep!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.250
Yes! These rainbow silkworm 
threads are great!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.970
The costume ideas are really flowing now!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.970
Lookin' good, Yuuki!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.660
Oh! I got lost in the moment...

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.110
Are you two...?

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.160
My name is Kokkoro.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.750
Heya! I'm Pecorine!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.930
You're the ones from the Gourmet Guild!

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:10.600
Thank you so much for finding 
this fantastic item for me!

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:14.090
Now I'll be able to make awesome 
costumes for our next concert!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.800
Concert?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:19.250
Is that a costume for our next concert?!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.990
I don't know why a boy 
is wearing it, though.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:25.450
Yeah! I'll use this thread to 
make the best costumes ever!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.880
That's what I like to hear!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:30.000
Um, our visitors look confused.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.000
I'm so sorry!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.580
Let me introduce us!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:38.930
We're the idol guild that sings, dances, 
and fights to protect everyone!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.740
It's called Carmina! Remember that!

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.140
Please do!

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.900
<b>PriConne</b>

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.630
Hi! I'm Karyl from the Gourm—

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:56.910
Huh?

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.280
Miss Karyl...

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.640
There's a good reason for this...

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.950
Do we look good?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.400
So you're Karyl? Nice to meet you!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:15.930
Nice!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.430
Nice proportions!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.310
Please be a model for me, too!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.370
Wait! Take it easy, Tsumugi!

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:26.280
N-N-No!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.070
How crazy is that?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.010
Nice!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.490
I'm just getting one idea 
after another today!

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:39.490
It's the gods! The gods 
have descended unto me!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.950
Y-You look lovely.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:46.010
Why did this happen?! You jerks!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.000
<b>Pri</b>

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.100
Honestly...

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:52.960
Seeing you in such a cute costume 
felt so new and different.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.600
Darn it, Koro-ster!
 Just forget that already!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.350
Anyway, I get that you sing and dance,

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.340
but what do you mean when you say you fight?

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.860
Those kinda seem like conflicting concepts.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:08.030
We put on concerts all over the place,

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.370
but for some reason 
monsters always show up.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:11.050
Huh?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:15.540
Since we always fight them off to ensure 
 our audience doesn't get hurt,

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.760
we became known as idols who 
sing, dance, and fight.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:19.450
You're kidding, right?

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.960
I mean, what the heck? That's insane.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:27.040
But still! We want to make 
everyone smile with our singing!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:33.220
Our dream is to let everyone in 
the continent hear our song one day.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.980
Make everyone smile? That's a lovely dream.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:41.010
I'll support Carmina's 
dream with all I've got!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.030
Thank you!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:47.100
We'll make our next concert 
a success, no matter what!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.920
Concert important!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.980
Right! Concerts are important!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:58.600
Hey, you've got cake all over your face.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.560
Oh, you'll stain your clothes.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.730
Go wash off out back.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:04.540
Okay.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.410
Splish, splish, splish...

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.310
Splish, splish...

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:14.600
Welcome to the entrance to Hell.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.370
We're the Carmina fan cl—

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:20.840
Dude! You're getting soaked!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:25.610
We're the Carmina fan club!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.020
You!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.840
Do you have any idea what you've done?

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.340
Don't go playing dumb!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.320
Carmina is...

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.690
...inviolable!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.060
Carmina is...

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:39.390
...sacred!

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:43.360
That's right! We're all guys 
who were saved by their music!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:47.290
Anyone who messes with Carmina will...

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.130
go... to... Hell!

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.060
Go... to...?

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.030
Drop the dumb act already!

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:58.620
How would you like to lose an arm or—

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.040
That's...

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.880
It's "Call Me Darling"!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.880
Music... important.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.680
Concert... important.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.930
Make everyone smile!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.500
Y-You...

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:34.910
Carmina's song will make everyone smile!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.800
My lord? Did you get your sleeve clea—Eep!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.720
You went to the rainbow silkworm nest?!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.350
A dangerous place like that?!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.610
All for Carmina's costumes?!

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.440
Serious respect!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:56.430
Who in the world are they?

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.960
Best buds! Respect!

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:01.550
Yahoo! Serious respect!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.410
I'm a spy...

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.110
Her Princess Knight.

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.480
Don't move!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.490
Good girl. Just give me 
all your money and...

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.980
What? What're you looking—

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:56.290
Enjoying a late-night stroll, I see.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.130
Christina...

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:01.810
Bringing another report, 
like a good little minion?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.950
How absolutely precious.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:05.970
What's the guard around the castle like?

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:09.280
You're the vice captain 
of Nightmare, aren't you?

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.130
Don't be so cold-hearted.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:16.190
When the Shadows went on a 
rampage in town not long ago...

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.700
Your group had something to do with it, yes?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.350
Bullseye, eh?

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:26.380
You must introduce me next time...

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:31.620
to the woman warrior who protected the 
town without a single casualty.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:40.030
That aside, I've come to pass 
along orders from Her Majesty.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:45.240
For whatever reason, 
she's given you and me a decree.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:49.120
The fact she went to 
the trouble of summoning us

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.990
can only mean one thing.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.580
There's work to be done in the shadows.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.050
So, tomorrow's the day, huh?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.330
The concert. I can't wait.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.830
I'm excited for the after-party, 
too! Aren't you, Karyl?

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.820
Sorry, but I have something I need to do.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.150
What? You can't be serious!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:16.970
Well, then, I'll bring back some 
food from the after-party!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:18.720
Let's all eat it together!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.510
I'm sure it'll be delicious!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.610
Sure, if I feel like it.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.160
Karyl?

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.290
Isn't your concert tomorrow?

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:19.560
Should you still be working 
so hard this late?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:28.200
When Nozomi dances, 
she shines really brightly.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.530
And Chika's singing has the power 
to pull in everyone who hears it.

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.320
But I don't have any of that.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.890
If I want to make Carmina shine brighter,

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.920
I need to practice a lot more

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.030
and reach the point where I can talk 
to the two of them on the same level.

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:50.840
I love making others shine.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:56.520
When Nozomi and Chika shine 
even brighter in my costumes,

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:00.340
and when that shine makes someone smile...

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:05.160
That might be what makes me truly happy.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.280
For someone else's sake...

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.530
Respect!

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.530
Best buds!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.080
Are we ready?

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.040
Yeah!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.420
We're the idols who sing, dance, and fight.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.170
We clear away people's sadness

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.920
and bring them smiles.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.670
Let's go! They're waiting for us!

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:43.020
Carmina on stage!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:33.370
It's pretty impressive that they can 
get so many people so fired up.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.130
Interesting.

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:40.060
What is it?

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:42.710
Nothing. I'm just surprised.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.480
I thought you had nothing 
in your head but fighting.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.030
You're not wrong.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.800
What I seek is excitement.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.540
And only the best, at that.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.310
They're here.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:08.740
Looks like the real party begins now.

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:49.100
So, these are stray Shadows...

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:54.070
Beings that were created to collect human 
souls but escaped Her Majesty's control

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:57.610
and became monsters that 
exist only to kill humans...

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:03.420
If all they do is kill the humans whose 
souls they're supposed to collect,

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.870
they're nothing but
 vile pests to Her Majesty.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.360
Now I get it.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:14.450
There's no way our stubborn 
captain could handle this.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:18.800
I'm sure she never even dreamed 
that the king we serve

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.430
would let such dangerous things run free.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:27.480
This is truly a job 
only you and I can do!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.090
My sweet Karyl.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.330
Imagine that.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:21.550
You're shining, too.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.050
I'm so tired.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:48.230
What... am I doing?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.790
Miss Karyl!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:21:00.840
Karyl!

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.510
Karyl!

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:03.740
Karyl!

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:04.450
Karyl?

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.150
A delicious meal is waiting for you!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.150
Miss Karyl?

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.650
There's meat, too!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.160
I don't see her.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:13.170
Karyl!

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:14.070
Karyl!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:16.250
Karyl?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.650
Miss Karyl!

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.740
Miss Karyl!

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:28.280
I am... her... Princess Knight...

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.410
Karyl!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.190
Not here.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.790
Let's try looking over there.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:40.930
Quit yelling so much.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:44.270
You're embarrassing me.

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:55.070
Welcome home, Karyl.

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:59.390
<i>For someone else's sake...</i>

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.380
Yeah, I'm back.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.970
Menu 3  <b> Tea Party in the Mysterious Forest
 ~Afternoon Carries the Scent of Danger~</b>
